  "seo": {
   "title": "BAT Project Aluminium Tile Angle 3m | Budget Trim | ETS Perth",
   "description": "BAT Project aluminium tile edge angle from $7.30. 8mm to 12.5mm, 3m lengths, 16 colours incl. matt gold, gunmetal and matt black. Perth."
  },
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>BAT's Project range is a lighter-gauge aluminium L angle made for volume jobs: apartments, builds and rentals where you need a lot of metres of trim at a sharp price. Same perforated fixing leg and colour range as the standard angle, in the most popular tile thicknesses.</p><ul>\n<li>Material: aluminium (project gauge), perforated fixing leg</li>\n<li>Length: 3m</li>\n<li>Sizes (tile thickness): 8, 9, 10, 11 and 12.5mm</li>\n<li>Finishes: Mill Finish, Bright Silver, Matt Silver, Linished Silver, Black, Matt Black, Matt White, Pearl White, Surfmist, Bronze Ash, Matt Gold, Linished Matt Gold, Gunmetal, Linished Gunmetal, Linished Iron, Linished Satin Nickel, Monument Matt</li>\n<li>Coloured finishes come with protective film</li>\n<li>Need a heavier gauge or other sizes? See the standard BAT Aluminium Tiling Angle</li>\n</ul><p><strong>Care:</strong> wash finished trims with warm soapy water and a soft cloth. Don't use acid or alkaline cleaners, scourers or sandpaper on coloured, anodised or plated finishes. Remove greasy marks with white spirits, then rinse with clean water.</p><p>BAT Trims is an Australian family business, making tiling trims in Dandenong, Victoria since 1985. Order through Excellent Tiling Services in Maddington, Perth.</p>",
